    "updated_at": "2026-07-16T09:25:56Z",
    "body": "So I think ideally we can linkify the words \"attribute definition\" to some concept that gets implemented by each of the attribute definitions (though many might be fully IDL now). Then also yes maybe the \"correspond to\" could be turned into a meaningful algorithm to make it explicit what is actually expected to happen.\n\nFor the second part \"I don't see anything that ensures this is the case\" as far as I know this is just spec editors ensuring that definitions work. Provided the attributes are defined properly then this will be true.\n\nI agree this can probably be clarified a bit and I agree the IDL stuff doesn't block this improvement.",
